26. Required end-to-end workflows
Ensure the following workflows function from beginning to end.
Workflow A: New advisor
Public homepage → Sign up → Authenticate → Onboarding → Configure firm → Import or connect data → Dashboard.
Workflow B: Client management
Dashboard → Add Client → Save → Open Client 360 → Add Financial Goal → Schedule Review → Generate Client Report.
Workflow C: Spreadsheet import
Data Hub → Upload Excel file → Preview → Map columns → Validate → Review changes → Confirm import → Update database → Refresh dashboard → Download import results.
Workflow D: Connected spreadsheet
Data Hub → Authorize Google Sheets → Select spreadsheet and worksheet → Map columns → Configure synchronization → Sync → Review imported records → Refresh dashboard metrics → View sync history.
Workflow E: Portfolio monitoring
Client 360 → Add or update holding → Recalculate portfolio totals → Refresh allocation chart → Evaluate configured thresholds → Create an alert when warranted → Resolve alert.
Workflow F: Financial planning
Client 360 → Create goal → Enter target and current savings → Calculate progress → Display the result → Generate a goal report.
Workflow G: Client access
Administrator or authorized advisor assigns a client account → Client signs in → Client sees only permitted information → Client opens a report → Client signs out.
Workflow H: Operations
Task created → Assigned to a team member → Notification generated → Task completed → Activity history updated.
Workflow I: Error recovery
Spreadsheet sync fails → Error shown → Existing valid records preserved → User opens details → Corrects the issue → Retries → Successful sync recorded.
Workflow J: Final session
User opens profile menu → Reviews settings → Signs out → Returns to the public welcome or sign-in page.
